 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545447,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "List all the names of those who have a path length of three from Uma.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The path length is the distance between two people on the shortest path. Count the number of steps it takes to get from one person to another. When you get to 3, you have found a name with a path length of three.</p>\n<p>Uma – 1(Vega) – 2(Lev) – 3(Jeffrey). Jeffrey has a path length of three from Uma.</p>\n<p>Uma – 1(Vega) – 2(Lev) – 3(Yara)</p>\n<p>Yara has a path length of three from Uma.</p>\n<p>Uma – 1(Kalani) – 2(Rohan) – 3(Jeffrey)</p>\n<p>This is Jeffrey again, so do not list him again.</p>\n<p>No one else has a path length of three from Uma, so only Yara and Jeffrey have a path length of three from Uma.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yara, Jeffrey"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
